# Conformance probe pack for a count whose group sits in an `opt` block
# (spec 0.21 rulings 6 and 18), most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   n           an 8-bit count: the number of nums plus 1
#   opt         one bit, then 7 unused bits and the n - 1 nums (val in 8 bits)
#               when it is 1
format     conformance-extents-unreached
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
count n 8 plus 1
opt
  pad 7
  group  probe.nums count @n
    field  probe.val  8  uint
  end
end
